{"title":"","link":"https://bradbarrish.com/2026/06/19/ive-always-admired-craig-newmark.html","date":1781895268000,"content":"<p>I’ve always admired <a href=\"https://craignewmarkphilanthropies.org/\">Craig Newmark</a>, especially <a href=\"https://www.independent.co.uk/us/money/craigslist-multimillionaire-craig-newmark-b2980681.html\">his approach to philanthropy</a>. The fact that he’s <a href=\"https://www.independent.co.uk/us/money/craigslist-multimillionaire-craig-newmark-b2980681.html\">being put in a position</a> to defend his philanthropy is absurd.</p>\n<p>Related: I enjoyed <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pZMuKkH92fo\">his appearance on Tyler Cowan’s podcast</a>.</p>","author":"","siteTitle":"Brad Barrish","siteHash":"91e49f51884b2947fac16e947ba7e59fe5a24800befb4760d388da1b057f4f23","entryHash":"92f72a9f77b2ee6b35dadd718d6c1dd320a46be01d27253fbb7ba6e954a0310d","category":"Sites"}